    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">It's Spooky Season!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A chill lingers in the air. It\u2019s that mystical time of year, where the veil between the possible and impossible thins. The stage is set, everything appears to be in place, yet something feels off. Halloween isn\u2019t unfolding as it should this year. Why? It\u2019s up to Perry the Pumpkin to uncover the mystery!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But wait, who exactly is Perry the Pumpkin? You\u2019re in the perfect place to find out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this thrilling platformer, you step into the shoes (or rather, the vines) of Perry the Pumpkin. Each area you explore unravels more secrets behind the chaos plaguing the spookiest night of the year. As you advance, Perry gains new abilities and discovers magical items. The world is brimming with power-ups, transforming your journey from a simple stroll to a magical flight on a broomstick. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Special Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as Perry the Pumpkin: What's cooler than that?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Need more evidence: Perry attacks by spitting pumpkin seeds at enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are a variety of items and power-ups that can be collected. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the different and meet unique characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Everything is basically themed around Halloween! Awesome! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncover mysteries and complete tasks for your new friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Entirely created and conceived by a son and his father. </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">It's Spooky Season!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A chill lingers in the air. It\u2019s that mystical time of year, where the veil between the possible and impossible thins. The stage is set, everything appears to be in place, yet something feels off. Halloween isn\u2019t unfolding as it should this year. Why? It\u2019s up to Perry the Pumpkin to uncover the mystery!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But wait, who exactly is Perry the Pumpkin? You\u2019re in the perfect place to find out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this thrilling platformer, you step into the shoes (or rather, the vines) of Perry the Pumpkin. Each area you explore unravels more secrets behind the chaos plaguing the spookiest night of the year. As you advance, Perry gains new abilities and discovers magical items. The world is brimming with power-ups, transforming your journey from a simple stroll to a magical flight on a broomstick. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Special Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as Perry the Pumpkin: What's cooler than that?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Need more evidence: Perry attacks by spitting pumpkin seeds at enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are a variety of items and power-ups that can be collected. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the different and meet unique characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Everything is basically themed around Halloween! Awesome! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncover mysteries and complete tasks for your new friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Entirely created and conceived by a son and his father. </p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Perry, who happens to be a pumpkin, is on a quest to collect various magical items for Welda the Witch. Welda needs these to help thwart an unknown threat. On his way, Perry will encounter various challenges including evil skeletons, ghosts, and ghouls. Will you help Perry complete his mission?",
